.TH "LX-MUSIC-SHELL" "1" "2024" "" "LX-Music-Shell Manual"
.SH NAME
lx-music-shell \- terminal music player
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lx-music-shell
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lx-music-shell
is a pure shell-based terminal music player that supports multiple music sources.
.PP
It can search and play music from various Chinese music platforms including Kugou, Kuwo, QQ Music, NetEase Cloud Music, MiGu, and Ximalaya.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-s, \-\-search \fIQUERY\fR
Search for music
.TP
.B \-\-test-sources
Test connectivity of all music sources
.TP
.B \-\-update-sources
Update music source configurations from network
.TP
.B \-\-import-source \fIFILE\fR
Import external source configuration file
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show version information
.SH INTERACTIVE COMMANDS
.TP
.B /search, /s
Search for music
.TP
.B /play, /p \fIINDEX\fR
Play music by index
.TP
.B /pause
Pause playback
.TP
.B /next, /n
Play next track
.TP
.B /prev
Play previous track
.TP
.B /test-sources
Test all music source connectivity
.TP
.B /quit, /q
Exit program
.SH CONFIGURATION
.TP
Configuration file: \fI~/.config/lx-music-shell/config\fR
.TP
Sources file: \fI~/.config/lx-music-shell/sources.list\fR
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Start interactive mode:
.B lx-music-shell
.TP
Search for music:
.B lx-music-shell --search "周杰伦"
.TP
Test all sources:
.B lx-music-shell --test-sources
